Z||000004||BBBAD GT||10-26-2000||10:53 PM||||Talked with my buddy who's site had the videos, and that particular car is basically a street race car in Detroit.  Pretty much stock suspension (no four link, but the stock ford rear is basically a four link), with just a 150 shot.  BTW, those two are two different runs, not the same with different camera angles.  Detroit has got to be one of the street race capitals, where 5 figure street races are common (and people drive around on slicks).<BR>  <P>------------------<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://scribers.midwest.net/bbbad50/BBBAD_GT_SIG.gif">    <P><A HREF="http://scribers.midwest.net/bbbad50/V8Fiero" TARGET=_blank>BBBAD V8</A><P><A HREF="http://scribers.midwest.net/bbbad50/Fiero.htm" TARGET=_blank>BBBAD GT</A><P><A HREF="http://scribers.midwest.net/bbbad50/" TARGET=_blank>BBBAD 5.0</A>||||reg||1
